---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="3CLEANING SERVICE | Blog" description="Professional cleaning services.">
<section class="breadcrumb">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Our Blog</h1>
            <div class="breadcrumb-nav">
                <a href="index.html">Home</a>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-right" style="font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                <span>Blog</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Cleaning Tips & Insights</h2>
                <p>Expert advice to keep your property clean, organized, and well-maintained.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="blog-grid">
                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-truck-loading"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> May 15, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Junk Removal</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">How to Prepare for Junk Removal: A Complete Checklist</a></h3>
                        <p>Make your junk removal day smooth and efficient with our comprehensive preparation guide.
                            Learn what to sort, what to keep, and how to maximize your service.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-spray-can"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> May 10, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Pressure Washing</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">Pressure Washing vs. Soft Washing: Which Do You Need?</a></h3>
                        <p>Understanding the difference between pressure washing and soft washing can save your surfaces
                            from damage. We break down when to use each method.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-home"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> May 5, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Home Tips</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">Spring Cleaning Guide for Tri-Cities Homeowners</a></h3>
                        <p>Get your home ready for summer with our Tri-Cities-specific spring cleaning checklist. From
                            yard prep to deep interior cleaning.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-recycle"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> April 28, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Eco-Friendly</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">Eco-Friendly Disposal: What Happens to Your Junk?</a></h3>
                        <p>Learn how we prioritize recycling and responsible disposal to minimize environmental impact
                            while clearing your space.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-dollar-sign"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> April 20, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Pricing</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">Understanding Junk Removal Pricing in 2026</a></h3>
                        <p>What factors affect junk removal costs? We break down pricing structures so you can budget
                            effectively for your cleanup project.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="blog-card">
                    <div class="blog-image"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i></div>
                    <div class="blog-content">
                        <div class="blog-meta">
                            <span><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i> April 15, 2026</span>
                            <span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> Maintenance</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3><a href="#">How Often Should You Pressure Wash Your Home?</a></h3>
                        <p>Maintenance schedules vary by surface and climate. Here's our expert recommendation for
                            Tri-Cities homeowners.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Read More</a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
</Layout>
